        10("<div style='font-weight: bold'>CQRS Unit of Work</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Custom .NET command and query handlers]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Owns IDE application logic.<br />Dispatches typed commands and<br />read-only queries to<br />registered handlers with<br />scoped context, validates<br />eligibility, and returns or<br />publishes their outcomes.</div>")
        style 10 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        30("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Verified Package Profiles</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET declarative profile validation]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Checks each declared debugger<br />profile's reference, schema,<br />path, and digest. Projects<br />available profile references<br />into project selection and<br />resolves the active<br />descriptor's reference under<br />its pinned package lease.</div>")
        style 30 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        4("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Workbench and Docking (View)</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia and Dock.Avalonia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Hosts menus, command bars,<br />keyboard bindings, documents,<br />and docked tools. Presents<br />command metadata and<br />localization, and applies the<br />system wait cursor to<br />logically blocked UI.</div>")
        style 4 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        40("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Emulators Management View</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia EmulatorsPane and EmulatorsViewModel]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Browses buckets, compatible<br />releases, and installed<br />versions. Shows project<br />version history, binding<br />readiness, and verified<br />profiles. Refreshes after UI<br />or MCP changes and discards<br />results for superseded<br />project selections.</div>")
        style 40 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        41("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Emulator Bundle Manager</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorWorkspace, Git, JSON, SHA-256]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Reads Git bucket manifests at<br />a recorded commit, selects a<br />compatible host target,<br />verifies archives and entry<br />points, and publishes<br />immutable versions with<br />receipts. Persists project<br />pins and rollback history.</div>")
        style 41 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        42("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Pinned Adapter Resolver</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorWorkspace and EmulatorBundleStore]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Resolves the project's<br />selected installed bundle for<br />the host and contract<br />version. Checks the<br />installation receipt and<br />binding entry point, exposes<br />verified profile references,<br />and supplies a lease for<br />session open.</div>")
        style 42 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        5("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Predefined Command Catalog</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: CommunityToolkit.Mvvm and typed .NET requests]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Registers typed IDE commands<br />and queries with stable IDs<br />and required capabilities.<br />Pairs UI commands with<br />Toolkit bindings and<br />localized metadata. Supplies<br />the MCP tool registry.</div>")
        style 5 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        8("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Main MVC Controller</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: GPS.SimpleMVC 2.0.0]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Owns dispatch and result<br />delivery for views registered<br />directly with it. Provides<br />the shared execution entry<br />point for typed requests from<br />all controllers into the<br />custom Unit of Work.</div>")
        style 8 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
      end

